# 🛒 Kasir App

A modern cashier application built with PHP Native and PostgreSQL to manage sales transactions, product inventory, and sales reports efficiently.

---

# Main Features

## Authentication
- Login system
- Session management
- Logout system

## Dashboard
- Total products statistics
- Categories statistics
- Transactions statistics
- Sales chart analytics

## Product Management
- Add products
- Edit products
- Delete products
- Upload product images
- Product search
- Pagination

## Category Management
- Create category
- Edit category
- Delete category

## Cashier Transactions
- Add to cart
- Automatic subtotal calculation
- Automatic total calculation
- Realtime change calculation
- Save transactions
- Save transaction details
- Automatic stock updates

## Reports
- Sales reports
- Data filtering
- Total revenue calculation
- Print reports

## Receipt
- Print transaction receipts
- Responsive receipt layout

---

# Case Study

This project was developed to help small businesses and stores manage sales transactions digitally, making cashier operations faster, cleaner, and more efficient.

---

# Tech Stack

- PHP Native
- PostgreSQL
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Chart.js

